{"4646290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animal Clicking", "steam_appid": 4646290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Clicking</strong> is<strong> </strong>a relaxing genre-mashup. It takes the cozy vibe of an island builder and fuses it with the addictive &quot;one more thing&quot; loop of a clicker game—all set on a vibrant, customizable island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a simple wheat field, get your first workers to help you with the clicking, and send the rocket to <strong><i>the motherland</i></strong> to unlock ever more ways to increase the harvest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and customize your island to your heart’s desire and create a beautiful <i>haven of glorious labor</i> and high-yield production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/c1e5855f787ef1d3cf5a89b03d628352.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/c1e5855f787ef1d3cf5a89b03d628352.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/c1e5855f787ef1d3cf5a89b03d628352.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every great harvest begins with a single click.</strong> Take direct control of your island's destiny by tending to your fields manually to jumpstart your production. Feel the progress as you click to make your crops sprout and flourish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, your effort translates directly into growth, turning tiny sprouts into a blooming fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/f923f353c3d67dd92d88dcb8e5762802.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/f923f353c3d67dd92d88dcb8e5762802.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/f923f353c3d67dd92d88dcb8e5762802.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The land is free, and the possibilities endless.</strong> Lay down sprawling crop fields or cozy animal pens to diversify your resources. Upgrade your buildings to unlock higher yields, increased capacity, and more efficient production. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a simple farm to a sophisticated agricultural hub, every upgrade brings you closer to perfecting your output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/54eeaeaaf4721221ec0c66aa06b932e3.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/54eeaeaaf4721221ec0c66aa06b932e3.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/54eeaeaaf4721221ec0c66aa06b932e3.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labor is cheap and plentiful.</strong> Recruit a cast of adorable, hardworking animals to do the dirty work for you. Use intuitive drag-and-drop mechanics to assign your workers exactly where they are needed most. Watch as your island comes to life, with your loyal workers growing, harvesting, and storing—<i>because they definitely love it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your workers at their <i>preferred workplace</i> to maximize output and keep your production flowing at rocket speed. As you unlock more help, you’ll shift from manual clicking to managing and overseeing your ever-expanding workforce. But be careful: overworking your furry workforce might lead to exhaustion and slower production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/4ee1837c556adb2a3f5940987130ecae.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/4ee1837c556adb2a3f5940987130ecae.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/4ee1837c556adb2a3f5940987130ecae.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Motherland</i> awaits your resources.</strong> Send your produce to the stars and unlock new possibilities. The rocket is always ready for your next delivery of fresh crops, produce, or gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load the rocket, launch it, and accelerate your progress. New crops, buildings, and decorations<strong> </strong>wait for you to be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/681f5507a48eaa9a68477a02ba0ec9e4.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/681f5507a48eaa9a68477a02ba0ec9e4.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/681f5507a48eaa9a68477a02ba0ec9e4.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two islands look the same!</strong> Experience a relaxing yet addictive progression system that rewards you <i>for your workforce's hard work.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play for twenty minutes or twenty hours, there’s always something new to click, build, or unlock on your glorious paradise.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Clicking</strong> is<strong> </strong>a relaxing genre-mashup. It takes the cozy vibe of an island builder and fuses it with the addictive &quot;one more thing&quot; loop of a clicker game—all set on a vibrant, customizable island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a simple wheat field, get your first workers to help you with the clicking, and send the rocket to <strong><i>the motherland</i></strong> to unlock ever more ways to increase the harvest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and customize your island to your heart’s desire and create a beautiful <i>haven of glorious labor</i> and high-yield production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/c1e5855f787ef1d3cf5a89b03d628352.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/c1e5855f787ef1d3cf5a89b03d628352.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/c1e5855f787ef1d3cf5a89b03d628352.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every great harvest begins with a single click.</strong> Take direct control of your island's destiny by tending to your fields manually to jumpstart your production. Feel the progress as you click to make your crops sprout and flourish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, your effort translates directly into growth, turning tiny sprouts into a blooming fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/f923f353c3d67dd92d88dcb8e5762802.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/f923f353c3d67dd92d88dcb8e5762802.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/f923f353c3d67dd92d88dcb8e5762802.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The land is free, and the possibilities endless.</strong> Lay down sprawling crop fields or cozy animal pens to diversify your resources. Upgrade your buildings to unlock higher yields, increased capacity, and more efficient production. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a simple farm to a sophisticated agricultural hub, every upgrade brings you closer to perfecting your output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/54eeaeaaf4721221ec0c66aa06b932e3.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/54eeaeaaf4721221ec0c66aa06b932e3.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/54eeaeaaf4721221ec0c66aa06b932e3.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labor is cheap and plentiful.</strong> Recruit a cast of adorable, hardworking animals to do the dirty work for you. Use intuitive drag-and-drop mechanics to assign your workers exactly where they are needed most. Watch as your island comes to life, with your loyal workers growing, harvesting, and storing—<i>because they definitely love it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your workers at their <i>preferred workplace</i> to maximize output and keep your production flowing at rocket speed. As you unlock more help, you’ll shift from manual clicking to managing and overseeing your ever-expanding workforce. But be careful: overworking your furry workforce might lead to exhaustion and slower production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/4ee1837c556adb2a3f5940987130ecae.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/4ee1837c556adb2a3f5940987130ecae.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/4ee1837c556adb2a3f5940987130ecae.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Motherland</i> awaits your resources.</strong> Send your produce to the stars and unlock new possibilities. The rocket is always ready for your next delivery of fresh crops, produce, or gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load the rocket, launch it, and accelerate your progress. New crops, buildings, and decorations<strong> </strong>wait for you to be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/681f5507a48eaa9a68477a02ba0ec9e4.poster.avif?t=1776958189\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/681f5507a48eaa9a68477a02ba0ec9e4.webm?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/extras/681f5507a48eaa9a68477a02ba0ec9e4.mp4?t=1776958189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two islands look the same!</strong> Experience a relaxing yet addictive progression system that rewards you <i>for your workforce's hard work.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play for twenty minutes or twenty hours, there’s always something new to click, build, or unlock on your glorious paradise.</p>", "short_description": "Animal Clicking is a cute, cozy island builder that blends farming, automation, and resource management with the addictive gameplay loop of clicker games into a completely new sandbox experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/23b3c8753b2466907d165765593f140e6a545d8b/header.jpg?t=1776958189", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/6a31af2d8eeeb3ab9a6535a77561105578858ccb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776958189", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646290/6a31af2d8eeeb3ab9a6535a77561105578858ccb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776958189", "website": "https://pypegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Mini